Product lineage
---------------

Catet.in implements a product and architecture brief derived from the
requirements document in this repository. The brief studies the public
PennyWise AI project by sarim2000:

  https://github.com/sarim2000/pennywiseai-tracker

PennyWise is licensed under AGPL-3.0. Catet.in is an independent Android
implementation written for this repository. It does not ship PennyWise's name,
logo, store assets, proprietary services, or trademark. PennyWise's copyright
and license continue to apply to PennyWise itself and to any code taken from
it. No such code is intentionally included here.

